{"assets":["/statement-assets/27ac3fbe38d6b75a7eed4fcb8dd72bd7093779e2c3269ea33a82eb17174aab13.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"833","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. The Meaningless Game"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/27ac3fbe38d6b75a7eed4fcb8dd72bd7093779e2c3269ea33a82eb17174aab13.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Slastyona and her loyal dog Pushok are playing a meaningless "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"game"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" that is indeed very interesting."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"game"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" consists of multiple "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"rounds"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Its rules are very simple: in each round, a natural number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" is chosen. Then, the one who says (or barks) it faster than the other wins the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"round"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". After that, the winner's score is multiplied by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k2"},{"kind":"text","text":", and the loser's score is multiplied by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". In the beginning of the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"game"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", both Slastyona and Pushok have scores equal to one."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unfortunately, Slastyona had lost her notepad where the history of all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"games"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" was recorded. She managed to recall the final results for each games, though, but all of her memories of them are vague. Help Slastyona verify their correctness, or, to put it another way, for each given pair of scores determine whether it was possible for a game to finish with such result or not."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first string, the number of games "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n ≤ 350000)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is given."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"game"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is represented by a pair of scores "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ a, b ≤ 109)"},{"kind":"text","text":" – the results of Slastyona and Pushok, correspondingly."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each pair of scores, answer \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if it's possible for a game to finish with given score, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output each letter in arbitrary case (upper or lower)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n2 4\n75 45\n8 8\n16 16\n247 994\n1000000000 1000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Yes\nYes\nYes\nNo\nNo\nYes\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"game"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" might have been consisted of one round, in which the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" would have been chosen and Pushok would have won."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"game"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" needs exactly two rounds to finish with such result: in the first one, Slastyona would have said the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":", and in the second one, Pushok would have barked the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"833A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/833/problem/A"}